@title Dialogs are windows: Preferences opens on screen, moves by its title bar and resizes
@area Windows
@sizes 1366x768
click_text "Open example"
wait 20
click_text File #1
wait 5
click_text Preferences
wait 20
shot preferences-home
check_layout
# Title bar to the lower right.
drag 683 125 900 250
wait 10
shot preferences-moved
check_layout
key Escape
wait 10
click_text File #1
wait 5
click_text Preferences
wait 20
shot preferences-again
check_layout
